已知：Cu^+的歧化反应
2Cu^+(aq) = Cu^{2+}(aq) + Cu(g)  ΔH_1 = 1212 kJ·mol^{-1}
Cu^+(aq) = Cu^+(g)  ΔH_2 = 582 kJ·mol^{-1}
Cu^{2+}(g) = Cu^{2+}(aq)  ΔH_3 = -42 kJ·mol^{-1}
Cu(g) = Cu(s)  ΔH_4 = -337 kJ·mol^{-1}
2Cu^+(aq) = Cu^{2+}(aq) + Cu(s)  ΔH
①根据上述信息，计算反应热 ΔH =___________kJ·mol^{-1}。
